  unitName: Maiden Cayena
  unitId: 810003
  unitNumber: 8000
  description: A mercenary from another world, she comes from a proud lineage of
    soldiers who fought only for righteous causes. She uses her rocket launcher,
    Feurig, bequeathed to her by her superiors, to bring swift, fiery justice against
    the wicked. Upon learning of the callous gods in Grand Gaia, she joined the Battle
    Maidens to end their reign.
  summonDesc: You need my help?<br>I'd be happy to,<br>but only if it's for a good
    cause!
  fusionDesc: I feel great!!!<br>Gimme more of that!
